    "description": "Iranian sportswear connects competitive uniforms, training clothing, and supporter merchandise. The national football team's use of Iranian manufacturer Majid in 2022 provides a documented example of domestic production reaching an international sporting stage.",
    "tags": ["Sportswear", "Iranian manufacturing", "Football kits", "Supporter merchandise"],
    "status": null,
    "editorial_status": "needs_research",
    "as_of_date": "2026-10-26",
